%% Authentication and authorisation flow
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Staff user
  participant FE as Next.js (browser)
  participant API as Spring Boot API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>FE: username + password
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  API->>DB: load user + roles, BCrypt verify, lockout check
  API->>DB: INSERT refresh_tokens(family F, hash(R1)), audit
  API-->>FE: 200 {accessToken A1 (15 min), user} + Set-Cookie dms_refresh=R1 (HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict, Path=/api/v1/auth)
  FE->>FE: keep A1 in memory only (never localStorage)
  FE->>API: GET /api/v1/patients/... Authorization: Bearer A1
  API->>API: verify signature, iss, exp, roles -> GrantedAuthorities
  API->>API: @PreAuthorize role check + ownership rules in service
  API-->>FE: 200 data (or 403 FORBIDDEN + ACCESS_DENIED audit)
  Note over FE,API: 15 minutes later
  FE->>API: GET ... Bearer A1 (expired)
  API-->>FE: 401 TOKEN_EXPIRED
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (cookie R1, X-Requested-With)
  API->>DB: SELECT token FOR UPDATE, valid & not rotated?
  API->>DB: mark R1 rotated, INSERT R2 (same family, same absolute expiry)
  API-->>FE: 200 {accessToken A2} + Set-Cookie dms_refresh=R2
  FE->>API: retry original request with A2
  alt R1 presented again > 30 s after rotation
    API->>DB: revoke family F (REUSE_DETECTED), audit
    API-->>FE: 401 SESSION_REVOKED -> login screen
  end
  U->>FE: Logout (or 30 min idle)
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout
  API->>DB: revoke family F
  API-->>FE: 204 + clear cookie, FE clears query cache
